{"about_the_game":"Fall of the Stick Knights is a <strong>local multiplayer</strong> game designed to play with friends. It features physics-based character controls, supports 1 to 4 players, includes AI enemies, and offers a <strong>deck-building system</strong> that permanently alters your stats.<br><br>FOSK is <strong>my first game</strong>, which I created for fun and to learn programming. It's heavily unfinished, but I believe playing with friends can still be an enjoyable experience.<br><br><strong>Why did I publish it on Steam?</strong> When I made this game, I was 16, and I simply wanted to release a game on Steam. <br>(the release date is 19.02.2025, but this game was in early access for about two years.)<br><br>Features:<br>-Character editor<br>-Over 40 different weapons<br>-Over 90 unique maps<br>-&quot;Deck-building&quot; cards<br>-Local multiplayer<br>-Controller and keyboard support<br>-Ton of bugs and imperfections<br><br>I hope you have a great time playing it with your friends!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2433950?t=1739988350","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2433950?t=1739988350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433950/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739988350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433950/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739988350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Fall of the Stick Knights is a <strong>local multiplayer</strong> ga